From 3b700c4720c751d96bf10cb4022635fa2c6187c3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] misc: mediatek: adapt the vendor CCCI utility library
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adapt boot information, reserved memory and broadcast interfaces to
MT6897, including the borrowed no-map handling correction.

Original-Commit: local development history
Original-Author: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Original-Date: 2026-10-20T07:19:48+08:00
Original-Commit: local development history
Original-Author: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Original-Date: 2026-10-20T07:23:45+08:00
