Source commit: 3c4ccd07d562 "Kernel: Xiaomi kernel_device_modules changes for
Redmi K70E Android U" by 何发云 <hefayun@xiaomi.com>, 2024-01-12.
Signed-off-by: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/misc/mediatek/ccci_util/Kconfig       | 47 +++--------
 drivers/misc/mediatek/ccci_util/Makefile      | 81 +++++--------------
 .../mediatek/ccci_util/ccci_util_broadcast.c  |  6 +-
